                        target="https://mlgb.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/catalog/book_4512">104</ref> were in
                     the same sale lots 696 and 697. Stark (1877) was the last known owner according
                     to the second edition of Medieval Libraries of Great Britain
                     (1964).</provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">Purchased by <persName role="fmo">J. M.
